{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":174605,\"title\":\"Liebesticket nach Hause\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"33-year-old Jackie has a real problem: Frederik Forster, the son of a rich and powerful Munich publishing family, has proposed to her - much to the displeasure of his mother Marianne - and Jackie has happily agreed. Now she just has to persuade her husband Tom to finally sign the divorce papers.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vV7DaJpPE3PbJ00KqohE3GNMifx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7O25jNtOk2uFRulBoSbCwX8gMnI.jpg\",\"rating\":3.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"year\":2008,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"DE\",\"name\":\"Germany\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Sebastian Vigg\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":28117,\"name\":\"Sebastian Vigg\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":31441,\"name\":\"Wolke Hegenbarth\",\"character\":\"Jackie Lindberg\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nH3eX697pg72YZNTlSDFqZl1zNP.jpg\"},{\"id\":17719,\"name\":\"Julian Weigend\",\"character\":\"Thomas Lindberg\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lqP2kIPuVLT8gbzt6945CikoOjw.jpg\"},{\"id\":48895,\"name\":\"Oliver Bootz\",\"character\":\"Frederik Forster\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yyCbsJQ4LIhebl1Ic6MxsVf2Exk.jpg\"},{\"id\":3762,\"name\":\"Christine Kaufmann\",\"character\":\"Marianne Forster\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6IRA29duwXpLd52DrNukcYJWr3B.jpg\"},{\"id\":118433,\"name\":\"Karin Düwel\",\"character\":\"Nadja\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6aveylkRKfl2qT7w7lliU3WEQTP.jpg\"},{\"id\":42877,\"name\":\"Nadja Becker\",\"character\":\"Nina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pxWwU3XM1CBoyNYuAtD8Q4zWM1t.jpg\"},{\"id\":13806,\"name\":\"Christian Grashof\",\"character\":\"Vater Jochen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mP38dXy17GwvWNPgj